# Windows deploy after sophon edits

This checkout is the WSL source tree. The chat TUI the user types `/search` into runs from `C:\Software\Python\NLP\Personal\sophon`.

After source changes, from this repo:

```bash
./scripts/deploy-windows.sh --skip-venv
```

Use `--sync-venv` when dependencies or `pyproject.toml` extras change. Restart the Windows **sophon** profile. The live process does not pick up new slash commands.
